{{!--
    Pre-launch indexing gate (QUI-988).

    The book is deployed at docs.quip.network/xquad but not yet announced,
    and QUI-977 is still correcting content. Deleting the meta tag below is
    the launch flip.

    Do not gate this in robots.txt instead: a disallowed page is never
    fetched, so a crawler never sees this tag, and the URL stays eligible
    for URL-only indexing. Crawlable plus noindex is what actually keeps
    pages out of the index.

    This is a handlebars comment, so it is stripped from the rendered page
    rather than shipped in the published HTML.
--}}
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
